#BlueJ class context
comment0.target=Canvas
comment0.text=\r\n\ Clase\ que\ representa\ el\ canvas\ y\ nosotros\ solo\ agregamso\ algunos\ metodos\ de\ ayuda\r\n\ Canvas\ is\ a\ class\ to\ allow\ for\ simple\ graphical\ drawing\ on\ a\ canvas.\r\n\ This\ is\ a\ modification\ of\ the\ general\ purpose\ Canvas,\ specially\ made\ for\r\n\ the\ BlueJ\ "shapes"\ example.\ \r\n\r\n\ @author\:\ Bruce\ Quig\r\n\ @author\:\ Michael\ Kolling\ (mik)\r\n\r\n\ @version\:\ 1.6\ (shapes)\r\n
comment1.params=
comment1.target=Canvas\ getCanvas()
comment1.text=\r\n\ Factory\ method\ to\ get\ the\ canvas\ singleton\ object.\r\n
comment10.params=milliseconds
comment10.target=void\ wait(int)
comment10.text=\r\n\ Wait\ for\ a\ specified\ number\ of\ milliseconds\ before\ finishing.\r\n\ This\ provides\ an\ easy\ way\ to\ specify\ a\ small\ delay\ which\ can\ be\r\n\ used\ when\ producing\ animations.\r\n\ @param\ \ milliseconds\ \ the\ number\ \r\n
comment11.params=
comment11.target=void\ redraw()
comment11.text=\r\n\ Redraw\ ell\ shapes\ currently\ on\ the\ Canvas.\r\n
comment12.params=
comment12.target=void\ erase()
comment12.text=\r\n\ Erase\ the\ whole\ canvas.\ (Does\ not\ repaint.)\r\n
comment2.params=width\ height
comment2.target=Canvas\ getCanvas(int,\ int)
comment2.text=\r\n\ Constrtuctor\ 2\ para\ el\ canvas,\ para\ construirlo\ dedas\ las\ dimensiones\r\n\ @param\ int\ width\ que\ es\ el\ ancho\r\n\ @param\ int\ height\ que\ es\ el\ alto\r\n\ @author\ Bryan\ Pinz\u00F3n\ -\ Valentina\ Prieto\r\n\ @version\ Lab1\ DOPO\r\n
comment3.params=
comment3.target=void\ clearAndClose()
comment3.text=\r\n\ Metodo\ que\ limpia\ todos\ los\ objetos\ del\ canvas,\ lo\ borra\ y\ oculta\ la\ ventana\r\n\ @author\ Bryan\ Pinz\u00F3n\ -\ Valentina\ Prieto\r\n\ @version\ Lab1\ DOPO\r\n
comment4.params=width\ height
comment4.target=void\ resize(int,\ int)
comment4.text=\r\n\ Cambia\ el\ tama\u00F1o\ del\ canvas\ ya\ creado\ y\ vuelve\ a\ dibujar\ lo\ que\r\n\ ya\ estaba\ en\ el,\ sin\ perder\ los\ objetos\ existentes.\ Se\ usa\ para\r\n\ que\ la\ maquina\ pueda\ crecer\ visualmente\ cuando\ se\ agregan\ mas\r\n\ ruedas\ de\ las\ que\ caben\ en\ el\ tamano\ inicial.\r\n\ @param\ width\ nuevo\ ancho\ deseado,\ en\ pixeles\r\n\ @param\ height\ nuevo\ alto\ deseado,\ en\ pixeles\r\n\ @author\ Bryan\ Pinz\u00F3n\ -\ Valentina\ Prieto\r\n\ @version\ Ciclo\ 2\r\n
comment5.params=title\ width\ height\ bgColour
comment5.target=Canvas(java.lang.String,\ int,\ int,\ java.awt.Color)
comment5.text=\r\n\ Create\ a\ Canvas.\r\n\ @param\ title\ \ title\ to\ appear\ in\ Canvas\ Frame\r\n\ @param\ width\ \ the\ desired\ width\ for\ the\ canvas\r\n\ @param\ height\ \ the\ desired\ height\ for\ the\ canvas\r\n\ @param\ bgClour\ \ the\ desired\ background\ colour\ of\ the\ canvas\r\n
comment6.params=visible
comment6.target=void\ setVisible(boolean)
comment6.text=\r\n\ Set\ the\ canvas\ visibility\ and\ brings\ canvas\ to\ the\ front\ of\ screen\r\n\ when\ made\ visible.\ This\ method\ can\ also\ be\ used\ to\ bring\ an\ already\r\n\ visible\ canvas\ to\ the\ front\ of\ other\ windows.\r\n\ @param\ visible\ \ boolean\ value\ representing\ the\ desired\ visibility\ of\r\n\ the\ canvas\ (true\ or\ false)\ \r\n
comment7.params=referenceObject\ color\ shape
comment7.target=void\ draw(java.lang.Object,\ java.lang.String,\ java.awt.Shape)
comment7.text=\r\n\ Draw\ a\ given\ shape\ onto\ the\ canvas.\r\n\ @param\ \ referenceObject\ \ an\ object\ to\ define\ identity\ for\ this\ shape\r\n\ @param\ \ color\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ the\ color\ of\ the\ shape\r\n\ @param\ \ shape\ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ the\ shape\ object\ to\ be\ drawn\ on\ the\ canvas\r\n
comment8.params=referenceObject
comment8.target=void\ erase(java.lang.Object)
comment8.text=\r\n\ Erase\ a\ given\ shape's\ from\ the\ screen.\r\n\ @param\ \ referenceObject\ \ the\ shape\ object\ to\ be\ erased\ \r\n
comment9.params=colorString
comment9.target=void\ setForegroundColor(java.lang.String)
comment9.text=\r\n\ Set\ the\ foreground\ colour\ of\ the\ Canvas.\r\n\ EXTENSION\ (proyecto\ slotMachine)\:\ en\ vez\ de\ reconocer\ solo\ 7\ nombres\r\n\ fijos,\ ahora\ se\ admite\ cualquier\ nombre\ de\ color\ valido\ segun\ el\r\n\ estandar\ CSS,\ usando\ la\ clase\ de\ apoyo\ CSSColor\r\n\ @param\ \ colorString\ \ \ el\ nombre\ del\ color\ CSS\ para\ el\ foreground\r\n
